  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Rycrit</defName>
    <label>rycrit</label>
    <description>Rycrits were hardy herd animals native to Ryloth. Twi'leks raised them for their hides, and as a source of meat (which is universally considered to be delicious). Their sharp teeth and hooves as well as their multiple nostrils were adaptations for dealing with Ryloths extreme weather and vicious predators. The cultural, culinary and practical significance of the Rycrit meant they could be found on numerous worlds as both domestic and wild stock.</description>
